# Smile at Death: "up to two" (CR 115.1d). Bot2 Bolts Bot1's Memnite on turn 2. Smile comes down on turn 5. At the turn 7 upkeep Bot1
# chooses no target (the Memnite is a legal one, but it need not be): it stays in the graveyard. At the turn 9 upkeep it chooses just
# the Memnite, which returns with a +1/+1 counter as a 2/2 - fewer than the most is enough.

